        "score": 40.0,
        "cleanliness_and_arguments": "The document is well-formatted and clearly itemizes the submitted documents. The no-new-matter certification is properly stated. However, the legal argument requesting a deferral of base fees to a new Notice of Fee Deficiency is fundamentally flawed.",
        "risks_and_liabilities": "Extreme risk of abandonment. By failing to pay the outstanding filing fees in response to the Notice to File Missing Parts and Notice of Incomplete Reply, the application will go abandoned upon the expiration of the 5-month extension period.",
